  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Talk360s Ambassador portal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Talk360 is the easiest calling app to make reliable and affordable phone calls to any offline number in the world. Unique to Talk360 is that this service is made accessible for the underbanked as well. The DGGF-TA has enabled Talk360 to explore opportunities to expand its services in India and Kenya. To support this, an advanced ambassador portal was further developed and improved by IT-developers from South Africa. Talk360 is not only helping customers in underbanked regions, but also supporting micro-entrepreneurship within the local communities through the Talk360 Ambassador portal. With this project 4 direct jobs, 19 indirect jobs, consisting of micro-entrepreneurs selling the app and 213 possible micro-entrepreneurs have been trained in the use of the app and marketing and sales techniques.</narrative>
  </description>
